{"version":1,"key":"article:26","content":{"id":26,"title":"跑马灯动画续","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54bc68c2-8400-46f4-ac53-1d3f82370322","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实习的时候写下了《跑马灯动画》这篇文档，为了性能考虑，当时完全是用 CSS 实现的动画，后面了解到 Web Animation API，性能完全不亚于 CSS，于是有了想法，完全使用 JS 来实现动画。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc6e61bf-cb66-4454-bc8e-86de06f69d96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跑马灯动画包括两部分："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"b8b0b011-ac52-41af-bed1-cbbd87c73dec","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0607988a-ae26-46a7-9e64-a8675a8cd53b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e0e3b7a-f0cf-4c39-83bc-70952bf4453a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跑马灯效果，内容在不断的滚动"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5b6d190a-b9c7-4832-8c1f-d799abca4158","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"45ea5357-d549-4607-bee7-6ae44e4fa0e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持动态加减速"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8d6d856-2ff1-4eda-97d5-89af7c25bb06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面我们将实现一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Marquee"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类，它的构建函数接受两个参数，需要动画的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"container"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和文本内容，并提供以下方法来控制动画："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d5a5141d-474c-480d-b245-7f4e0b2bae3a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"72a57512-3bdf-4fec-8625-ac71ff63dbd5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"850fef63-a838-4ef9-b254-f1e83daf2dd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c57f94a2-2f2e-477c-abfb-f9f920848662","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93fa0d2b-9009-4b02-bfd4-5e64294938af","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pause"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9c7e473c-cd5a-4838-9daa-32d1fa6da9cd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d19b1a69-3d90-4cb7-8d66-afc9d1c7ea8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resume"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"53150d55-6407-4e33-b141-68d1a1eabf34","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20f2b1f4-aa14-4a97-9664-a001b187a4f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"speedUp"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"86e65fa2-7c56-424d-a2f6-dd09a6223cde","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"246ba701-a8d5-4f83-9d43-5d90f5080269","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slowDown"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36974d70-bef8-4035-b419-f7bcb1518d92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用示例如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"97419354-cf46-4b35-98a8-d6990b6eff87","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"492556dd-7c05-436d-8ca2-93aa21cab84a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>跑马灯</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"box\"></div>\n  <div>\n    <button id=\"start\">开始</button>\n    <button id=\"pause\">暂停</button>\n    <button id=\"resume\">恢复</button>\n    <button id=\"speedUp\">加速</button>\n    <button id=\"slowDown\">减速</button>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"./index.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    let marquee = new Marquee(document.getElementById('box'), '我的世界好精彩，我的世界好无奈！你还要我怎样，要怎样！');\n    window.addEventListener('resize', (e) => {\n      marquee = new Marquee(document.getElementById('box'), '我的世界好精彩，我的世界好无奈！你还要我怎样，要怎样！');\n    });\n    start.addEventListener('click', () => marquee.start());\n    pause.addEventListener('click', () => marquee.pause());\n    resume.addEventListener('click', () => marquee.resume());\n    speedUp.addEventListener('click', () => marquee.speedUp());\n    slowDown.addEventListener('click', () => marquee.slowDown());\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>","collabId":"9234b7a4-b278-49ec-b25a-0cb95d1c1f0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01TU72Ku1hNQ7IWzYFK_!!6000000004265-2-tps-914-278.png","previewUrl":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01TU72Ku1hNQ7IWzYFK_!!6000000004265-2-tps-914-278.png","width":373.569474522864,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"865c333e-b04d-407b-9353-638b2cae5cf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ec51710-1ecd-438c-a665-54c8bfa3cbd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内容滚动当前仅当内容的长度大于容器的长度才会发生，如果内容的宽度小于容器的长度，那么不必滚动。要实现源源不断的滚动，一般需要将文本复制一遍，以实现首尾相连的效果。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"494ec477-8709-47fb-b047-a73a91508686","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c22ad566-fd39-4a4d-b2a6-9ae1f5afe0f3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const getTextWidth = (text, font) => {\n  const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  ctx.font = font;\n  const metrics = ctx.measureText(text);\n  return metrics.width;\n}\n\nclass Marquee {\n  constructor(container, content) {\n    const width = container.offsetWidth;\n    const font = window.getComputedStyle(container).font;\n    const textWidth = getTextWidth(content, font);\n\n    if (textWidth > width) {\n      const text = content.repeat(2);\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${text}</div>`;\n    } else {\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${content}</div>`;\n    }\n\n    container.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    container.style.whiteSpace = 'nowrap';\n\n    this.animationContainer = container.firstElementChild;\n    this.textWidth = textWidth;\n    this.useAniation = textWidth > width;\n  }\n}","collabId":"333e416f-e81a-43fa-ad0e-9483d159e154","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08fbb432-ed69-42ec-abb3-6b835cdd1015","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"element.animate"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法可以创建一个自动开始的动画，并且该方法返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Animation"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，通过该实例可以控制动画"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"317d6179-d15a-4ceb-894e-688f0f9ef806","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"35fcdda0-5c08-49d7-bd56-1b8395ccfadd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Marquee {\n  constructor(container, content) {\n    const width = container.offsetWidth;\n    const font = window.getComputedStyle(container).font;\n    const textWidth = getTextWidth(content, font);\n\n    if (textWidth > width) {\n      const text = content.repeat(2);\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${text}</div>`;\n    } else {\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${content}</div>`;\n    }\n\n    container.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    container.style.whiteSpace = 'nowrap';\n\n    this.animationContainer = container.firstElementChild;\n    this.textWidth = textWidth;\n    this.useAniation = textWidth > width;\n  }\n\n  start() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation = this.animationContainer.animate([{\n      transform: 'translateX(0)',\n      offset: 0\n    }, {\n      transform: 'translateX(-' + this.textWidth + 'px)',\n      offset: 1\n    }], {\n      duration: 3000,\n      iterations: Infinity,\n    })\n  }\n}","collabId":"37764cc8-1ebe-410f-be1d-51814fb9cab2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3d0d75cb-911b-4d1a-89d8-8928dbaeea09","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Animation"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例包含如下方法和属性控制动画："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"039bb2e0-357c-4bc3-896e-a44dfcc6ae47","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6334d34b-6f48-4ec2-bce6-01737ebabe4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb166fba-e5bd-4068-9ec1-e7d57c54c0dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"play"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：开始或恢复动画运行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"694aa775-1b2b-48f5-8a81-9188c03f7faa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"083828d8-e415-4537-8e32-7163ecd95909","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pause"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：暂停动画"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ca6d3752-1ce7-40e7-8492-0d46a55a8084","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f99401da-c288-4c3a-b9c5-607f19adce3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"playbackRate"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：控制动画的运行速率，我们可以直接通过该属性来控制动画的加减速"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd03aa64-97d5-4a6a-956f-1e20a7888fa3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此完整实现如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"00e13d73-6544-4864-8c52-a0052bed1891","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"18765702-e214-4a14-b0e3-ca4fa719fe7a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Marquee {\n  constructor(container, content) {\n    const width = container.offsetWidth;\n    const font = window.getComputedStyle(container).font;\n    const textWidth = getTextWidth(content, font);\n\n    if (textWidth > width) {\n      const text = content.repeat(2);\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${text}</div>`;\n    } else {\n      container.innerHTML = `<div>${content}</div>`;\n    }\n\n    container.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    container.style.whiteSpace = 'nowrap';\n\n    this.animationContainer = container.firstElementChild;\n    this.textWidth = textWidth;\n    this.useAniation = textWidth > width;\n  }\n\n  start() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation = this.animationContainer.animate([{\n      transform: 'translateX(0)',\n      offset: 0\n    }, {\n      transform: 'translateX(-' + this.textWidth + 'px)',\n      offset: 1\n    }], {\n      duration: 3000,\n      iterations: Infinity,\n    })\n  }\n  \n  pause() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation.pause();\n  }\n  \n  resume() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation.play();\n  }\n  \n  speedUp() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation.playbackRate = this.animation.playbackRate * 2;\n  }\n  \n  slowDown() {\n    if (!this.useAniation) {\n      return;\n    }\n    this.animation.playbackRate = this.animation.playbackRate / 2;\n  }\n}","collabId":"7784bb7b-cfa6-4597-8800-b40e4fea28e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"green","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"7578a9f8-ae8b-4056-b988-963489c402e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"56a5b3a2-2ec4-424e-83a1-c10e128090e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之前使用 CSS 苦思冥想的动态加减速直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"playbackRate"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个属性就可以实现，真的感觉十分的 amazing！"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d08f85ce-cdec-430b-9a2e-e53125c819fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ed87ca37-cad0-437a-aa19-619e297f0406","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"726b08ea-cc42-4224-bf26-00cbf31bf799","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36de3ebf-7616-483b-9239-0c243b66248b","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Animations_API","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4b01a328-ac2a-47e9-8cfa-ba1aeb0bc44b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Web Animations API"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e6b3d91b-e08a-42eb-a4d7-286bd7bdb7a5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df57862e-8275-4310-9437-17690d29b1d3","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Animation","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"310f76a1-d067-4ce8-b71a-3fc4c5b3764d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Animation"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["Web Animation API","跑马灯","动画"],"bannerBg":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/wallhaven-y8267k_f67ff7b7-8479-47c6-8256-ebc03c44e089.png","createTime":1697901473816,"updateTime":1775869710761},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1775869710761}}